llergies</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">No known environmental allergies</td><td>The subject has no known environmental allergy conditions.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://tx.hl7europe.eu/r4/ValueSet/absent-unknown-uv-ips#absent-unknown-uv-ips-no-known-food-allergies\">no-known-food-allergies</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">No known food allergies</td><td>The subject has no known food allergy conditions.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
